Follow `docs/research/PROGRESS_REPORTING_RULE_V1.md`.
Every major development/research report ends with its complete PROGRESS block,
after the existing ENGINE STATUS block.
Daily completion counts planned executable work; external-input waits are
WAITING_FOR and do not reduce daily completion.
Overall progress covers prediction engines/research/operations, excluding UI.
Use the owner-set baseline; never invent percentage increases.
Progress phases do not imply implementation, admission, or engine promotion.
